{title: Poochho Na Kaise Maine Rain Bitayi}
{artist: Manna Dey S D Burman}
{key: G#}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#] [C#m] [G#],        Puchho na kaise maine rain bitai
[G#] [C#m] [G#],        Puchho na kaise maine rain bitai
[G#] [C#m],        Ik pal jaise, ik jug beeta
[G#] [C#m],        Ik pal jaise, ik jug beeta
[G#] [C#m] [G#],        Jug bite mohe nind na aayi
[G#] [C#m] [G#],        Puchho na kaise maine rain bitai
[G#] [C#m],        Ik jale deepak ik man mera
[C#m] [G#],        Phir bhi najaye mere ghar ka andhera
[G#] [C#m],        Ik jale deepak ik man mera Man mera
[G#] [C#m],        Ik jale deepak ik man mera Man mera
[C#m] [G#],        Phir bhi najaye mere ghar ka andhera
[G#] [C#m],        Tadpat tarsat umar gawayi
Puchho na kaise maine rain bitai
